Title: LIQPLAT Statistical Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("LIQPLAT", "Analysis Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "analysis@example.invalid")
Description: Source-oriented statistical analysis plan, schemas, diagnostics,
